1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,010
One in five of you

2
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,650
can wiggle your ears.

3
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:03,800
No eyebrows!

4
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,130
Nope?

5
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:05,933
Your brain lost the remote

6
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:07,690
for your ears...

7
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:10,230
about twenty-five million years ago.

8
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:11,448
So it mashes the buttons

9
00:00:11,448 --> 00:00:12,800
it DOES have...

10
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:14,320
EYEBROWS!

11
00:00:14,521 --> 00:00:15,880
Your ear muscles?

12
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:16,760
Still there.

13
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:17,900
Three per ear.

14
00:00:17,934 --> 00:00:19,417
And the wires still work:

15
00:00:19,417 --> 00:00:20,403
a sound beside you

16
00:00:20,403 --> 00:00:22,350
makes that ear twitch.

17
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:23,346
Strain to hear

18
00:00:23,346 --> 00:00:24,598
at a loud party...

19
00:00:24,598 --> 00:00:25,930
and the top ones

20
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:27,087
FLEX.

21
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,730
They're still trying.

22
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:29,790
Are you?

